<h3><u>Dua-e-Kumail</u></h3>
                <div style="width:100%">
                                <p><p>(Ya sari ar-reza) x6</p>

<p>Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>

<p>1. Tu hi kabir tu hi kibriya tu rehnuma, Rage gulu se bhi nazdeek tu har ek lamha.<br />
&nbsp;Hai tere naam ki taasir har maraz ki dawa, Hai tere zikr me poshida mere hak me shafa,<br />
(baghair maange hi karta hai tu ataa pe ataa) x2<br />
Sadaa se pehle hi sunta hai saelo ki sada</p>

<p>(ya sari ar reza) x2 Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>

<p>2.Ali wasila bane aur komail paye shafa, Usi ke naam se mansoob hogayi ye dua,<br />
Shabe jumaa hai dua-e-komail shukr tera,<br />
Ye ibteda hai to hai intehan hadise kisaa,<br />
(elahi teri riza ke siwaa kuch aur nahi) x2<br />
ke mere paas dua ke siwa kuch aur nahi</p>

<p>(ya sari ar reza) x2 Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>

<p>3. Mere khuda wo zabaane jo teri hamd kare, Wo tere panjatan-e-paak ki dua me rahe,<br />
Kabhi wo nare jahanum ki sakhtiya na sahe, Pule siraat se bekhof bekhatar guzre,<br />
(gunahagaro ko ye aasra hai subho masa) x2<br />
khula huwa hai musalsal tera dare tawba</p>

<p>(ya sari ar reza) x2 Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>

<p>4. Rasule paak ke sadke me ay khuda ghar ghar,<br />
Shoaaye ilm ki kirno ka mustakil ho guzar,<br />
Khula rahe mere bacho pe shahre ilm ka dar,<br />
Rahe jawaano ki har dam teri riza pe nazar,<br />
(teri riza ki bina riske ilm kya ho ataa) x2<br />
jo tune chahe dare ilm khil nahi sakta</p>

<p>(ya sari ar reza) x2 Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>

<p>5. Tu mere aib chupata hai daal kar parda, Elahi deta hu mai tujko waasta uska,<br />
Wohi jo shaame ghariban me de rahi thi sadaa, Nahi hai kuch bhi mere paas is rida ke siwaa<br />
(rasool zadi ke parde ki laaj rakhlena) x2 haram duaawo ka meri bhi aaj rakhlena</p>

<p>(ya sari ar reza) x2 Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>

<p>6. Shakhista pahlue zehra ka wasta ay khudaa, Jo waqte gusle ali ne basad buqa dekha,<br />
&nbsp;To apne aasu ali saa jari na rok sakaa, Khuda ka shehr bhi ek cheekh maar kar roya,<br />
(usi rasool ki beti ka waasta ay khudaa) x2<br />
ho waalidain ko sehat ke saath umr ataa</p>

<p>(ya sari ar reza) x2 Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>

<p>7. Wo ek mariz jo bas shaam keh ke rota tha, Jukaaye sar wo hayadar rota jaata tha,<br />
Pahen ke beriyaan jo karbala se shaam gaya, Usi mariz ke sadke se mangta hai shafa,<br />
(maraz se pehle dawa khalk tune ki hai khuda) x2<br />
baraye sayyade sajaad de hame bhi shifa</p>

<p>(ya sari ar reza) x2 Ighfir leman la yamleko ilad dua, Fa innaka fa&rsquo;alool lema tasha, Ya manismahu dawa wa zikrahu shifaa, Wa tahtahu ghenan</p>
</p>